  "verseCount": 25,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "24",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "NUM 24"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "24",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 24:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And when Balaam saw that it pleased the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NUM.24.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NUM.24.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to bless Israel, he went not, as at other times, to seek for enchantments, but he set his face toward the wilderness.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Balaam lifted up his eyes, and he saw Israel abiding",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "in his tents",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NUM.24.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NUM.24.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "according to their tribes; and the spirit of God came upon him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he took up his parable, and said, Balaam the son of Beor hath said, and the man whose eyes are open hath said:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He hath said, which heard the words of God, which saw the vision of the Almighty, falling",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "into a trance",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NUM.24.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NUM.24.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", but having his eyes open:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "How goodly are thy tents, O Jacob,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NUM.24.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NUM.24.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "thy tabernacles, O Israel!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As the valleys are they spread forth, as gardens by the river's side, as the trees of lign aloes which the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NUM.24.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NUM.24.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hath planted,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NUM.24.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NUM.24.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "as cedar trees beside the waters.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He shall pour the water out of his buckets, and his seed",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "shall be",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NUM.24.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NUM.24.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in many waters, and his king shall be higher than Agag, and his kingdom shall be exalted.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 24:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "God brought him forth out of Egypt; he hath as it were the strength of an unicorn: he shall eat up the nations his enemies, and shall break their bones, and pierce",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "them",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NUM.24.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NUM.24.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "through with his arrows.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He couched, he lay down as a lion, and as a great lion: who shall stir him up? Blessed",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NUM.24.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NUM.24.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "he that blesseth thee, and cursed",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NUM.24.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NUM.24.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "he that curseth thee.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 24:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ And Balak's anger was kindled against Balaam, and he smote his hands together: and Balak said unto Balaam, I called thee to curse mine enemies, and, behold, thou hast altogether blessed",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "them",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NUM.24.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NUM.24.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "these three times.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Therefore now flee thou to thy place: I thought to promote thee unto great honour; but, lo, the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NUM.24.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NUM.24.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hath kept thee back from honour.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Balaam said unto Balak, Spake I not also to thy messengers which thou sentest unto me, saying,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If Balak would give me his house full of silver and gold, I cannot go beyond the commandment of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NUM.24.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NUM.24.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", to do",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "either",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NUM.24.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NUM.24.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "good or bad of mine own mind;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "but",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NUM.24.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NUM.24.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "what the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NUM.24.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NUM.24.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "saith, that will I speak?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And now, behold, I go unto my people: come",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "therefore, and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NUM.24.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NUM.24.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will advertise thee what this people shall do to thy people in the latter days.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ And he took up his parable, and said, Balaam the son of Beor hath said, and the man whose eyes are open hath said:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He hath said, which heard the words of God, and knew the knowledge of the most High,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "which",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NUM.24.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NUM.24.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "saw the vision of the Almighty, falling",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "into a trance",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NUM.24.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NUM.24.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", but having his eyes open:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I shall see him, but not now: I shall behold him, but not nigh: there shall come a Star out of Jacob, and a Sceptre shall rise out of Israel, and shall smite the corners of Moab, and destroy all the children of Sheth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Edom shall be a possession, Seir also shall be a possession for his enemies; and Israel shall do valiantly.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 24:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Out of Jacob shall come he that shall have dominion, and shall destroy him that remaineth of the city.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
